      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ligonier%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1894, the former horse corral called the Diamond became a park with a bandstand, a centerpiece of town life.",
